<!DOCTYPE html>
<html dir="rtl" lang="ar">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Evaluation Report - <%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ep-orange: #1B4FBF;
            --ep-navy: #0F172A;
            --ep-slate: #1E293B;
            --ep-muted: #64748B;
            --ep-light: #F8FAFC;
            --ep-white: #ffffff;
            --ep-border: #E2E8F0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Cairo', 'Inter', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--ep-white);
            color: var(--ep-slate);
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
            print-color-adjust: exact;
        }

        .report-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ep-orange);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .logo-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .logo-img {
            height: 50px;
            width: auto;
        }

        .logo-text {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .logo-text .ar {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--ep-navy);
        }

        .logo-text .en {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ep-muted);
            font-family: 'Inter';
        }

        .report-title-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .report-title {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--ep-navy);
            margin: 0 0 5px;
        }

        .report-subtitle {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--ep-muted);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .kpi-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .kpi-card {
            background-color: var(--ep-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--ep-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .kpi-value {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--ep-orange);
            font-family: 'Inter';
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .kpi-stars {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .kpi-stars svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            fill: #FFB020;
            color: #FFB020;
        }

        .kpi-stars svg.empty {
            fill: none;
            color: var(--ep-border);
        }

        .kpi-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ep-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--ep-navy);
            border-right: 4px solid var(--ep-orange);
            padding-right: 10px;
            margin: 30px 0 20px;
        }

        .distribution-section {
            background-color: var(--ep-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--ep-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .bar-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .bar-label {
            width: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .bar-container {
            flex: 1;
            height: 12px;
            background-color: var(--ep-border);
            border-radius: 99px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .bar-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #FFB020;
            border-radius: 99px;
        }

        .bar-value {
            width: 50px;
            text-align: left;
            font-family: 'Inter';
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ep-muted);
        }

        .breakdown-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .breakdown-table th, .breakdown-table td {
            padding: 12px 15px;
            text-align: right;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ep-border);
        }

        .breakdown-table th {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--ep-navy);
            background-color: var(--ep-light);
        }

        .breakdown-table td {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .breakdown-table td.center {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Inter';
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--ep-border);
            padding-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--ep-muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="report-container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo-section">
                <% if (logoBase64) { %>
                    <img class="logo-img" src="<%= logoBase64 %>" alt="Yaser USMLE Step 1 Logo">
                <% } %>
                <div class="logo-text">
                    <span class="ar">ياسر USMLE الخطوة الأولى</span>
                    <span class="en">Yaser USMLE Step 1</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ep-muted); font-family: 'Inter';">
                    <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('ar-EG') %>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="report-title-section">
            <h1 class="report-title">تقرير نتائج التقييم الأكاديمي</h1>
            <p class="report-subtitle"><%= title %> • <%= subtitle %></p>
        </div>

        <div class="kpi-row">
            <div class="kpi-card">
                <div class="kpi-value"><%= overallRating.toFixed(1) %></div>
                <div class="kpi-stars">
                    <% for(let i = 1; i <= 5; i++) { %>
                        <% if (i <= Math.round(overallRating)) { %>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <svg class="empty" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
                        <% } %>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
                <div class="kpi-label">التقييم العام للمساق / المحاضر</div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-card">
                <div class="kpi-value"><%= totalResponses %></div>
                <div style="height: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px;"></div>
                <div class="kpi-label">إجمالي عدد المشاركين بالتقييم</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="section-title">توزيع التقييمات (النسب المئوية)</h2>
        <div class="distribution-section">
            <% 
                const sum = Object.values(distribution).reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) || 1;
            %>
            <% [5, 4, 3, 2, 1].forEach(stars => { 
                const count = distribution[stars] || 0;
                const percentage = Math.round((count / sum) * 100);
            %>
                <div class="bar-row">
                    <div class="bar-label">
                        <span><%= stars %></span>
                        <svg style="width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: #FFB020;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bar-container">
                        <div class="bar-fill" style="width: <%= percentage %>%;"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bar-value"><%= percentage %>% (<%= count %>)</div>
                </div>
            <% }) %>
        </div>

        <% if (questionBreakdown && questionBreakdown.length > 0) { %>
            <h2 class="section-title">تحليل الأسئلة والاستبيانات التفصيلية</h2>
            <table class="breakdown-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 60%;">السؤال / معيار التقييم</th>
                        <th style="width: 20%; text-align: center;">متوسط التقييم</th>
                        <th style="width: 20%; text-align: center;">عدد الاستجابات</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <% questionBreakdown.forEach((row, idx) => { %>
                        <tr>
                            <td><%= row.question %></td>
                            <td class="center" style="color: var(--ep-orange);"><%= row.avgRating.toFixed(1) %> / 5.0</td>
                            <td class="center"><%= row.responses %></td>
                        </tr>
                    <% }) %>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        <% } %>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>صدر هذا التقرير إلكترونياً عن النظام الداخلي لمنصة ياسر للتحضير لامتحان USMLE Step 1.</p>
            <p>Yaser USMLE Step 1 © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
